Well… I can see that may be a right solution to it, to use something
like ‘evolutionary software' so the bot can develop its own
strategies, but also base them with information the bot must know so
it can do it right, let's say the general way to solve Sokoban, or
maybe some tactics to ID items (and not necessarily by cost-ID'ing
them, maybe the way rog-o-matic does it is a better way).

"David Damerrell" <damerrell@chiark.greenend.org.uk> wrote:
